PROGRAM LINEAR REGRESSION
DATA X, Y
READ X, Y
COMPUTE MEAN X INTO XBAR
COMPUTE MEAN Y INTO YBAR
COMPUTE SUM (X - XBAR) * (Y - YBAR) INTO NUMERATOR
COMPUTE SUM (X - XBAR) ** 2 INTO DENOMINATOR
COMPUTE NUMERATOR / DENOMINATOR INTO SLOPE
COMPUTE YBAR - SLOPE * XBAR INTO INTERCEPT
PRINT SLOPE, INTERCEPT
END PROGRAM